<p>The blue jump-intercepted function declaration is <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">/// - Tag:push</code>. The <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Tag</code> must be written with exact casing and no spaces; it uses the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">x-source-tag</code> scheme to jump to <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">push</code>.</p>

